  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Anchor Examples keeps content where you put it in the real world, using spatial anchors.
    Pinch New Area and look around slowly while the space is mapped, then place note, watch and photo widgets from the panel.
    Exit the area and enter it again from My Areas, even after relaunching the Lens: the widgets come back where you left them.
